  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EHi {{NAME}}\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou tried to sign in but you haven\u0027t activated your account yet. Please click this link or paste it into your browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://{{DOMAIN}}/account/activate?token={{TOKEN}}\u0022\u003Ehttps://{{DOMAIN}}/account/activate?token={{TOKEN}}\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis link will expire in 24 hours, and replaces the one we sent before. If you left it too late, \u003Ca href=\u0022https://{{DOMAIN}}/account/reset-password\u0022\u003Ereset your password\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
